Archie is a human member of the [[Org/Velvet Mark/index|Velvet Mark]] and the party's driver. He wears leather armor under a dark cloak and carries a bandolier of daggers across his chest, with a rapier at his side. He is a master of moving unheard.

Before he joined the Velvet Mark, Archie was an Undercrofter of [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei|Iomenei]]. Tipped off by the fighting pit's bookie, he followed [[People/Barlow Crane|Barlow Crane]], [[People/Grant FireEye|Grant FireEye]] and [[People/Gage|Gage]] into a forsaken sector of the city after the saboteur there, and fought the [[Bestiary/Hivemother|Hivemother]] and its swarm beside them. He was trained in first aid and had a healing potion to share. He left the city afterward.
